cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PHM-Vibench, cite the exact release tag or Git commit used for
  your experiment. A preferred paper citation or DOI has not yet been published.
title: PHM-Vibench
type: software
authors:
  - name: PHMbench contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/PHMbench/PHM-Vibench
url: https://github.com/PHMbench/PHM-Vibench
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  PHM-Vibench is a configuration-first workbench for industrial vibration
  fault-diagnosis experiments. Its maintained public surface is defined by
  repository configs, support documents, tests, and runtime evidence.
keywords:
  - prognostics and health management
  - fault diagnosis
  - vibration signals
  - time series
  - benchmark
